@startuml FSM Sequence - Observed Bot Behavior
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA

title FSM Sequence Diagram - Observed Bot Behavior\n(Based on Log Analysis)

actor "System" as SYS
participant "FSM Machine" as FSM
participant "Bot Context" as CTX
participant "Drone Fleet" as DRONE
participant "Movement System" as MOVE

== System Initialization ==
SYS -> FSM : System Start
FSM -> CTX : Create initial context
FSM -> FSM : Enter EVALUATING state

== Auto Exploration Trigger ==
SYS -> FSM : AUTO event (periodic)
FSM -> FSM : Check guards:\n- hasUnexploredAreas ✅\n- isDroneInactive ✅
FSM -> FSM : Transition: EVALUATING → EXPLORING_DEPLOYING
FSM -> DRONE : Deploy explorer drone
FSM -> CTX : Update context with drone deployment

== Drone Deployment Phase ==
DRONE -> FSM : DRONE_REACHED_TARGET event
FSM -> FSM : Check guard: droneReachedTarget ✅
FSM -> FSM : Transition: EXPLORING_DEPLOYING → EXPLORING_PROSPECTING
FSM -> CTX : Update exploration status

== Prospecting Phase ==
DRONE -> FSM : PROSPECTING_COMPLETE event
FSM -> FSM : Check guards:\n- explorationComplete ✅\n- needsEmergencyReturn ❌
FSM -> FSM : Transition: EXPLORING_PROSPECTING → EXPLORING_RETURNING
FSM -> CTX : Prepare return to base

== Return Phase - PROBLEMATIC ==
note over FSM : ⚠️ BOT GETS STUCK HERE
FSM -> MOVE : Request movement to base
MOVE -> FSM : MOVEMENT_STARTED event
FSM -> FSM : Stay in EXPLORING_RETURNING\n(Update movement status)

MOVE -> FSM : MOVEMENT_PROGRESS event
FSM -> FSM : Stay in EXPLORING_RETURNING\n(Update position)

' The problem: BASE_REACHED is never triggered
note over MOVE : ❌ BASE_REACHED event\nnever gets triggered
note over FSM : Bot remains stuck in\nEXPLORING_RETURNING state

== Missing Transitions ==
note over FSM, CTX
**MISSING TRANSITIONS:**
1. EXPLORING_RETURNING → IDLE_AT_BASE
   - Event: BASE_REACHED
   - Guard: isAtBase
   - ❌ Never triggered

2. Alternative completion paths
   - No timeout mechanism
   - No fallback transitions
   - No manual recovery
end note

== Available but Unused States ==
note over FSM
**UNUSED STATES:**
- COLLECTING: Available but never used
- RETURNING: Replaced by exploring_returning
- Manual transitions work but not used

**UNUSED EVENTS:**
- RESOURCE_COLLECTED
- INVENTORY_FULL  
- AREA_EXPLORED
- REFUEL_COMPLETE
- UNLOAD_COMPLETE
end note

@enduml
